                                        "sense_id": "2e7ad2a7-e753-3a75-9dcd-20849e78449d",
                                        "entry_id": "5fca1528-38f2-35ec-8a35-ec25e43bebcf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resistant to the effects of water."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4355131b-a779-3812-9ec3-5145e9fb658a",
                                        "entry_id": "5fca1528-38f2-35ec-8a35-ec25e43bebcf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Made of or covered with material that doesn't allow water in."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "206e80fb-0771-3500-adc4-4494a3515be7",
                                        "entry_id": "5fca1528-38f2-35ec-8a35-ec25e43bebcf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incapable of failing; unassailable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f282882f-c646-4cda-a9a4-b9b6c0e8e60e",
                                                "sense_id": "206e80fb-0771-3500-adc4-4494a3515be7",
                                                "text": "The only waterproof plan and the one increasingly adopted by leading trades is the consolidation of the interests of all parties in a scheme of amalgamation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f030873-b5bd-4e58-a40b-7c23214509e3",
                                                "sense_id": "206e80fb-0771-3500-adc4-4494a3515be7",
                                                "text": "Especially within an international framework, guarding this process is of the utmost importance. The eyes of the world are focussed on the action at hand and demand a waterproof plan and execution."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "180385f3-0738-4723-84b6-636c5e1af4c7",
                                                "sense_id": "206e80fb-0771-3500-adc4-4494a3515be7",
                                                "text": "Unless you have a 100 percent waterproof plan to defraud insurance companies, I would suggest you don't do it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "waterproof",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "380aaebe-855f-3eab-803f-cb1ece110184",
                                        "entry_id": "ef2cce12-79d3-3ea1-ba10-de8bb899d343",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make waterproof or water-resistant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "761038fa-0536-4778-af8a-2bb836caad56",
                                                "sense_id": "380aaebe-855f-3eab-803f-cb1ece110184",
                                                "text": "The dawn of the oil age was fairly recent. Although the stuff was used to waterproof boats in the Middle East 6,000 years ago, extracting it in earnest began only in 1859 after an oil strike in Pennsylvania. The first barrels of crude fetched $18 (around $450 at today’s prices)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "waterproof",
